// The GPU tier's own workspace: the tier, the gg backend and the core.
//
// It is not in the repository's go.work because a workspace has one build list
// and the tier holds wgpu below v0.33 — gg v0.52.5 makes the render-pass calls
// wgpu v0.33 turned into struct arguments — while backend/window composites
// through stilus/gpu on wgpu v0.34. The go command finds this file by itself
// from inside this directory, so `cd backend/gg/gpu && go test ./...` builds
// against the core and backend/gg in the tree, and applies this module's
// replacement of gg with the fork that carries the tier's fixes.
//
// The tier is deprecated with backend/gg (docs/adr/0094).
go 1.25.0

use (
	.
	../
	../../../
)
